lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:13px'&gt;[Spring Cloud Gateway, :8080]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:14px'&gt;Единая точка входа, роутинг по пути запроса&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="580" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-8" value="&lt;span style='font-size:18px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;users-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:13px'&gt;[Spring Boot + JPA, :8081]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:14px'&gt;Игроки, кошельки и балансы&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="880" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-9" value="&lt;span style='font-size:18px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;market-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:13px'&gt;[Spring Boot + JPA, :8082]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:14px'&gt;Предметы и лоты. Оркестрирует сделку покупки&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="560" y="880" width="300" height="170" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p2-10" value="&lt;span style='font-size:18px'&gt;&lt;b&gt;notifications-service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:13px'&gt;[Spring Boot, :8083]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:14px'&gt;Принимает отчеты о сделках, пишет в лог контейнера&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#438DD5;strokeColor=#3C7FC0;fontColor=#FFFFFF;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=